Inspect the exact committed material considered by the review boundary

Usage: ai-cockpit work-item material-review <COMMAND>

Commands:
  plan    Build the canonical read-only material-review request for an active Work Item
  record  Record a self-declared typed decision only when Contract opt-in and current Runtime admission allow it; this is not human, provider, or release approval
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help
